    <data key="d0">Sanofi Real World Evidence Analytics Platform</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2L0m28ZLmtE</data>
    <data key="d2">Sanofi built a secure analytics portal on AWS using S3 static hosting, CloudFront, Cognito federated with corporate SSO, API Gateway, DynamoDB for audit tracing, Service Catalog for provisioning R Studio and SageMaker environments, and Lambda with Translate and Comprehend Medical for NLP processing.</data>
    <data key="d3">Healthcare &amp; Life Sciences</data>
    <data key="d4">True</data>
